"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ……………
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>ここに入る気は起きない…
#. 絶対に…もう入りたくない…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I really don't wanna go in... I don't wanna see this\n"
